cy":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":-0.012713196103669167,"_gp_pool_share":false,"_score_pool_share":34.9,"_gate_rev_durability":0.13832358207721684,"_gp_rev_durability":true,"_score_rev_durability":94.2,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":-0.05596853204796503,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.005168095744512602,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":43.5,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.02255618883750941,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":62.4,"_gate_insider_own":0.08968,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":59.8,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Customers Bancorp, Inc. operates as the bank holding company for Customers Bank that provides banking products and services for commercial and consumer clients. It accepts various deposit banking products, including commercial and consumer checking accounts, non-interest-bearing and interest-bearing demand accounts, MMDA, savings accounts, and time deposit accounts. The company also offers commercial lending services comprising small and middle market business banking, specialized lending, mortgage finance, multifamily and commercial real estate lending, and commercial equipment financing; and consumer lending services, such as local-market mortgage and home equity lending, and the origination and purchase of installment loans. In addition, it provides private and digital banking services; and other financial services consisting of mobile phone banking, internet banking, wire transfers, electronic bill payment, lock box services, remote deposit capture services, courier services, merchant processing services, cash vault, controlled disbursements, positive pay, and cash management services, as well as B2B instant payments platform. The company was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in West Reading, Pennsylvania.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Samvir S. Sidhu | President, CEO & Vice Chairman | Compensation: $850,144 (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 860 people. Revenue per employee of $952K ranks in the above the sector median among Financial Services peers, improving at 22%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $559K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $21K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Customers Bancorp, Inc is a mid-cap financial services business with a $2.9B market cap on $818M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years and +14% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $481M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 59 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.21\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 5.6% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 9.0% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $21.4M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 72% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Among the least levered in Financial Services \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Head to Head Analysis: Customers Bancorp (CUBI) & Its Rivals","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/head-to-head-analysis-customers-bancorp-cubi-it